Rule 1 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 2 (tensor has valid shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (tensor should have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor shape is compatible with batch norm)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 3] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (tensor shape matches batch norm)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 3] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 12 (tensor should be of type float or int)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = "float32" ∨ dtype_(v_1) = "int32"
>>
Rule 21 (tensor should not be zero)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≠ 0
